{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4158820/extras/21084b4ff9ef0a2f7b003cf18fefc27a.avif?t=1768387895\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chess Knightmare is a variant of chess that is NOT turn-based. The only limit to how often you can move is how fast you can move your mouse. You play as a lone knight, traveling through the country and taking on the armies of chess pieces from your opponents. Each opponent piece has a certain behavior and movement patterns. Try to take the opponent's king with quick thinking, fast mouse speed, and clever knight maneuvers. As you progress, you will be able to unlock a special additional piece that will help you defend yourself: The Rock. Use it to block the opponent from taking you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content;</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 different opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 bonus gamemodes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 different time controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 skins to unlock</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Finished Training","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4158820/da8c6cd75e26009ccc89a271b04d9bdb8ae21d7b.jpg"},{"name":"Settle Divorce","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4158820/d21b79fadf2cb99d65730f21dc74a1bbff3b7199.jpg"},{"name":"Avoid Penetration","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4158820/4c09f1a39ae2138afdf5f10c4eaee44e8317cdfe.jpg"},{"name":"Slaughter The Cow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4158820/80dff5b6a7d50bf93076403ba4f7f7f79038d26d.jpg"},{"name":"Handle The Big Black Ro